Dua Lipa adalah seorang penyanyi dan penulis lagu berkebangsaan Inggris. Lagunya yang berjudul "Hotter than Hell" dinominasikan di Popjustice £20 Music Prize sebagai Best British Pop Single pada tahun sebelumnya. Album debut Lipa dirilis pada tahun 2017 dan mendapat beberapa nominasi, termasuk Album of the Year di 2017 BBC Music Awards, MasterCard British Album of the Year di Brit Awards 2018, dan International Album of the Year di LOS40 Music Awards 2018. Single keenam dari album berjudul "New Rules" mendapat beberapa nominasi seperti Best Video di BAMA Music Awards 2017, British Single of the Year dan British Video di Brit Awards 2018, Best Music Video di iHeartRadio Music Awards 2018.
Lagu ini juga mendapat nominasi sebagai International Video of the Year dan International Song of the Year di LOS40 Music Awards 2018, Global Hit of the Year di MTV Millennial Awards 2018, Song of the Year di MTV Video Music Awards 2018, Best Track dan Best Video di NME Awards 2018, Best Use of Video, Best Use of YouTube, Best in Hospitality, dan Best Use of Facebook Video di Shorty Awards 2018, Choice Song: Female Artist di Teen Choice Awards 2018, Pop Song of the Year di Beano Awards 2017, dan VEVO Must See Award di UK Music Video Awards 2017. Disamping nominasi, "New Rules" memenangkan British's Best Single di BBC Teen Awards 2017, Direction for Music Videos di D&amp;AD Awards 2018, Best Song To Lip Sync To di Radio Disney Music Awards 2018, dan Best Pop Video – UK di UK Music Video Awards 2017.
